{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0133_1000_p", "source_sha256": "025d5c6101a249d299227c51cdcdc9652789806a2058a6211a237bbd1550fe5d", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影で、\nスーツ姿ののり子を撮ることになった！）", "zh": "（要在拍摄写真杂志《爱格拉！！》时，拍下穿着西装的法子！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0133_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "295b6eba6ebc9ff8e15f7107675f584be50e868cfa3738bfed61a8e974dcd86a", "ja": "あはは……。\nなんか、就活生になったみたい……。", "zh": "啊哈哈……\n总觉得，好像变成了求职生一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0133_1002_p", "source_sha256": "19e4632ac1ae67f6ad061b066da059b8d2a62184152ac9079e039369ad5f37a5", "ja": "よく似合ってるぞ、のり子！　心なしか、\nいつもより表情が引き締まって見えるよ。", "zh": "很适合你哦，纪子！不知是不是我的错觉，你看起来表情比平时更加严肃了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0133_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "4a5602233de87d300cea31b991c9c87f5009cbff0852063b1a8d7d534bc6c7d5", "ja": "あ、やっぱり顔に出ちゃってる？\nスーツのせいか、ちょっと緊張しちゃってるかも……。", "zh": "啊，果然还是表现在脸上了吗？\n可能是因为穿着西装，稍微有点紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0133_1004_p", "source_sha256": "568990e70c31f8ecd670f7c4d5b384b1bc683f75747b2e8874fcbcdcc1b4bc21", "ja": "そうなのか？\n緊張しなくても、いつもどおりで大丈夫だぞ。", "zh": "是这样吗？\n不用紧张，像平时一样就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0133_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "4bcd6ddf9386bc0e49b2b986dc00b40803c8bb2ee26a8533751e44c438460c15", "ja": "そうは言っても、スーツなんて慣れてないからさ～。\nポーズもどうすればいいのか、よくわからないし。", "zh": "话是这么说，可我还不习惯穿西装嘛～  \n而且我也不太清楚该摆什么姿势。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0133_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "49452edb04780609f02df442c122f0d76a42d9e7b08a46bdaeaddc8fb5d634c4", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}はいつも\nスーツでしょ？　普段、どんなポーズしてるの？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}不是总穿西装吗？平时都摆什么姿势？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0133_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f2372d9116dff2d00fe496f05fbb497f955ab4f63b0475f41f8e29ab6ab9f667", "ja": "どんなポーズと言われても……\nアイドルじゃないから、ポーズは取らないかなぁ。", "zh": "就算问我摆什么姿势……  \n我又不是偶像，平时应该不会特意摆姿势吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0133_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "c2a796ff815fe976265fed289f13629c89805416aaf4d9452a594d6f7a89ddc8", "ja": "あはは、それもそっか！\nとはいえ、うう、どうしよう……。", "zh": "啊哈哈，说得也是！\n话虽如此，呜，该怎么办才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0133_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e78516d52d43bcee4748fec50a41f82fdc00fb1cc12be56bf62837cf6267c563", "ja": "難しく考えなくても、のり子がこれだって思う\nポーズにすればいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "不用想得太复杂，摆出自己觉得\n最适合的姿势不就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0133_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "581efa653718fef1aabc1215ac4f63ec833487d578db7d38c581f7958a6732c0", "ja": "そうなの？　……じゃあ、\nファイティングポーズとか取っちゃおうかな！", "zh": "这样吗？……那要不摆个战斗姿势之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0133_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "19fba5177e9cc03c58023dc7801f29004040c8eb81017db7f477b49743043e4f", "ja": "それとも気合いを入れるために、\nカメラに向かってパーンチ！　……とか！？", "zh": "还是说，为了鼓足干劲，\n对着镜头来一记——拳！……之类的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0133_1012_p", "source_sha256": "739613f8420129fc908b041f210f952682866945c54749c465d550fb477360d0", "ja": "おお、いいじゃないか！　なんだか、\n元気が出るグラビアになりそうな気がするよ。", "zh": "哦，挺不错嘛！感觉会变成让人精神振奋的写真呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0133_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "2f86c9ea6f2d7d5c5a6ac30bbd56f51d01c5b0ce720effaeab133032f545a66c", "ja": "えっ？　{$P$}、いいの？\n冗談のつもりだったんだけど……。", "zh": "诶？{$P$}，这样好吗？\n我本来只是开个玩笑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0133_1014_p", "source_sha256": "854d14e5615aa77fb05c68413e1bce439458de8e73ddb6db49febce87e6f95aa", "ja": "いや、今の笑顔はなかなか良かったと思う。\nのり子なら、色んな人に元気を与えてくれそうだ。", "zh": "不，我觉得你刚才的笑容相当不错。\n如果是则子的话，感觉一定能给很多人带去活力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0133_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "3d67b06893b3df7300b48195ccc68a00b54fef97f6a810f2ea164051644ad763", "ja": "そ、そうかな……？\n{$P$}も、元気もらえそう？", "zh": "这、这样吗……？{$P$}也能打起精神来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0133_1016_p", "source_sha256": "94939f4d942b813814a4753a52f1f9fda955c3564c009004965baff28f4ebfbd", "ja": "もちろん！　のり子みたいな同僚がいたら、\n毎日の仕事も楽しくこなせそうだよ。", "zh": "当然！要是有像德莉子这样的同事，\n每天的工作也会变得愉快，感觉能顺利完成呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0133_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "32795a69738a61a32b1264d49a02499e7a2b130da3fb21b35be58ee3608fc689", "ja": "そっか……へへっ。そういうことなら、うん！\nなんだかできそうな気がしてきた！", "zh": "这样啊……嘿嘿。既然这样，那就好！\n不知怎么的，感觉自己好像能做到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0133_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "d99b5758a541dd5338bf041b648ed557b2eba47317ed47287d47895196786686", "ja": "よーしっ、燃えてきたー！　見ててね、\n{$P$}！　バッチリ決めてくるから！", "zh": "好——嘞，燃起来了——！好好看着吧，\n{$P$}！我一定会完美拿下的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
